-羅斯，我們必須要放下這件事 -把袋子給我

149
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:31,350
No, I don't know what else to do. I said I'm sorry, now..
不，我不知道還能怎樣 我已經道歉了，現在…

150
00:10:31,530 --> 00:10:34,520
Now you should scream at me or curse me or hit me.
現在你應該對我吼叫、咒罵 或是打我

151
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:37,790
- I'm not gonna hit you. - You'll feel better. I'll feel better.
-我不會打你的 -你會比較好過，我也會比較好過

152
00:10:37,970 --> 00:10:40,560
You know you want to, I can see it in your eyes.
你知道，你想打我 我從你眼中看得出來

153
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,060
- I don't. - A little bit.
-我不想 -有一點

154
00:10:43,270 --> 00:10:45,140
- No. - Little bit.
-不想 -有一點

155
00:10:46,310 --> 00:10:48,400
- No. - A little bit more.
-不想 -多一點了

156
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:51,270
- Give me the bag. Give me the bag. - No, hit me. Hit me.
-把那個袋子給我，把袋子給我 -不，打我，打我

157
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,540
- Give me the bag. I'm not kidding. - Hit me.
-給我袋子，給我袋子 -打我

158
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:55,720
- No. - Hit me. Hit me. Hit me!
-不 -打我，打我，打我！

159
00:11:08,100 --> 00:11:11,430
- You ducked! - I'm sorry! It was a reflex!
-你閃開了！ -我很抱歉！這是反射動作！

160
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:15,030
- Oh, my God! This really hurts! - I couldn't help it.
-喔，天啊！真的好痛！ -我不得不閃哪！

161
00:11:15,270 --> 00:11:19,100
When a fist comes at your face, you duck. Look.
當有拳頭要打上你的臉 你會閃啊，瞧

162
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:23,770
What is the matter with you?
你是怎麼搞的？

163
00:11:23,980 --> 00:11:26,040
You were supposed to duck! Why didn't you?
你應該要閃的！為什麼沒閃呢？

164
00:11:26,250 --> 00:11:28,220
Let's talk on the way to the hospital.
我們去醫院的路上再談

165
00:11:28,420 --> 00:11:32,880
Good. Yeah, maybe while we're there, they can check your reflexes.
好，是啊，或許當我們過去的時候 他們可以檢查一下你的反射神經

166
00:11:47,770 --> 00:11:50,740
- Try feeding her again. - I already fed her.
-再餵她看看 -我已經餵過了

167
00:11:50,940 --> 00:11:53,600
I know. That's why I said, "Again!"
我知道，所以我說「再」

168
00:11:54,780 --> 00:11:57,010
You guys, we can't turn on each other, okay?
你們，我們不可以窩裡反，好嗎？

169
00:11:57,210 --> 00:11:59,440
That's just what she wants.
這正是她想要的

170
00:12:00,210 --> 00:12:01,980
- Hi. - Hey.
-嗨 -嘿

171
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:05,440
I told you you shouldn't have let her watch Terms of Endearment.
我告訴過你別讓她看《親情關係》

172
00:12:06,190 --> 00:12:08,780
- Can I talk to you outside? - Just stay here.
-我們可以到外面談談嗎？ -待在這裡

173
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:11,360
I'm gonna check her diaper. Phoebe, you want to come?
我要去檢查她的尿布 菲比，你要不要一起來呢？

174
00:12:11,530 --> 00:12:14,360
I'm kind of part of this.
這事與我也有關

175
00:12:16,660 --> 00:12:19,000
Actually, it's a husband-and-wife kind of thing.
事實上，這是夫妻兩人之間的事

176
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:21,670
I knew I should've married Chandler.
我就知道我應該嫁給錢德的

177
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:26,000
- Okay, what's up? - Okay.
-好了，怎麼回事呢？ -好的

178
00:12:26,310 --> 00:12:29,070
You know we said it would be fun to move to Paris for a year?
我們曾經討論過如果能搬到巴黎 住一年一定會很棒

179
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,910
And you could study French cooking, and I could write..
你可以學習法式烹飪 我可以寫作…

180
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:36,380
and we could picnic along the Seine, and go wine-tasting in Bordeaux.
我們可以在塞納河畔野餐 去波爾多品酒

181
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:38,680
- Yeah. - Okay.
-是啊 -很好

182
00:12:38,850 --> 00:12:42,410
You know how people say that Tulsa..
你知道有些人說土爾沙…

183
00:12:43,860 --> 00:12:46,020
is the Paris of Oklahoma?
就像是奧克拉荷馬州的巴黎嗎？

184
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:50,090
What? Who says that?
什麼？是誰說的？

185
00:12:51,130 --> 00:12:53,830
People who have never been to Paris?
那些從沒去過巴黎的人說的

186
00:12:54,540 --> 00:12:58,700
- Well, what's going on? - We're moving to Tulsa.
-到底是怎麼回事？ -我們要搬去土爾沙了

187
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,770
- Excuse me? - Okay.
-你說什麼？ -好吧

188
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:06,740
Ms. McKenna, she kind of works above my boss.
我老闆的上司，麥肯納小姐

189
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:09,970
- I think you actually met her. - Don't care. Get back to Tulsa.
-我想你應該見過她 -我不在乎，快說土爾沙是怎麼回事

190
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:13,750
She asked me to move to Tulsa and be president of our office there.
她要我搬到土爾沙 去當那邊分公司的總經理

191
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:16,820
And I was sleeping and apparently said yes.
我當時正在打瞌睡，然後 顯然我是答應她了

192
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:20,890
- Tulsa, Oklahoma? - The Sooner State.
-奧克拉荷馬州的土爾沙？ -早到者之州

193
00:13:22,430 --> 00:13:24,230
Whatever that is.
不管那是什麼東東

194
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:27,760
Chandler, I don't even want to see the musical Oklahoma.
錢德，我連歌舞劇《奧克拉荷馬》 都不想看

195
00:13:27,970 --> 00:13:30,800
"Oh, What a Beautiful Morning, " "Surrey With the Fringe on Top"?
「喔，美妙的早晨」 「坐在馬車上頭」（奧劇內容）

196
00:13:31,010 --> 00:13:35,470
Are you trying to tell me we're moving to Oklahoma or that you're gay?
你是在說我們要搬去奧克拉荷馬 還是說你是同性戀？

197
00:13:38,250 --> 00:13:40,150
I don't think I can get out of this.
我想我可能躲不掉了

198
00:13:40,310 --> 00:13:42,650
- Oh, my God! - But you don't know..
-喔，天啊！ -但是你不知道…

199
00:13:42,820 --> 00:13:45,650
it could be like Paris. You can still take a cooking class..
土爾沙可能會像巴黎一樣 你還是可以在當地的大學…

200
00:13:45,820 --> 00:13:48,650
at Oral Roberts University.
上烹飪課

201
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:53,120
All right, not that this matters, but did they at least offer you a huge raise?
好吧，這些都沒關係 但至少他們有幫你加薪吧？

202
00:13:53,330 --> 00:13:57,590
No. But they are going to lease us a Ford Focus.
沒有，但是他們會 幫我們租一台福特小車

203
00:13:59,430 --> 00:14:02,370
- I'll get out of it. - Thank you.
-我會試著脫身 -謝謝

204
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:04,670
- What is wrong with Emma? - She misunderstood.
-艾□是怎麼了？ -她誤會了

205
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:07,000
She thought she was moving to Tulsa.
她以為是她要搬到土爾沙

206
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:14,210
Ma'am, do you have a minute?
請問您現在有空嗎？

207
00:14:14,380 --> 00:14:18,780
I kind of have some bad news. I don't think I can move to Tulsa.
我有些壞消息 我想我不能去土爾沙了

208
00:14:19,290 --> 00:14:24,020
- What? - It's a funny story, actually.
-什麼？ -事實上這是件很好笑的事

209
00:14:24,730 --> 00:14:28,130
I kind of fell asleep in the meeting this morning.
我在今天早上的會議上睡著了

210
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:31,820
So when I said I'd move to Tulsa, I didn't really know what I was saying.
所以當我說我可以搬到土爾沙時 我根本不知道我在說什麼

211
00:14:32,030 --> 00:14:33,190
You fell asleep?
你睡著了？

212
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:36,060
But only because I was up all night worried about this meeting.
但那是因為我整晚為會議擔心而失眠

213
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:37,640
Isn't that funny?
是不是很好笑呢？

214
00:14:39,510 --> 00:14:42,130
Irony. Not a fan? All right.
很諷刺，不好笑？好吧

215
00:14:44,110 --> 00:14:45,480
See, here's the thing.
好吧，事情是這樣的

216
00:14:45,650 --> 00:14:49,100
I went home and told my wife about Tulsa, and she won't go.
我回家告訴我老婆土爾沙的事 但是她不想去

217
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:53,150
See me, I love Tulsa. Tulsa is heaven. Tulsa is ltaly.
至於我，我愛死土爾沙了 土爾沙是天堂，土爾沙是意大利

218
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:55,350
Please don't make me go there.
拜託別逼我搬去那裡

219
00:14:55,590 --> 00:14:58,560
- Chandler, I.. - I know that you're upset..
-錢德，我… -我知道你很不高興…

220
00:14:58,730 --> 00:15:02,390
but I just.. I would really rather just stay here.
但是我只是… 我真的寧可留在這裡

221
00:15:04,060 --> 00:15:05,960
Not here in your office..
不是說在你的辦公室這裡…

222
00:15:06,130 --> 00:15:07,960
here at the company..
而是在這裡的這間公司

223
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:11,260
where I'm rapidly feeling unwelcome.
我在這裡超有歸屬感的

224
00:15:12,070 --> 00:15:15,130
No, look, Carol. Can I call you Carol?
聽著，凱蘿 我可以叫你凱蘿嗎？

225
00:15:17,210 --> 00:15:19,150
Why would I when your name is Elaine?
我真不應該 因為你的名字是依蓮

226
00:15:24,790 --> 00:15:27,310
What a great picture of your son. Strapping.
你兒子拍得真棒，雄壯威武

227
00:15:29,390 --> 00:15:32,450
That's a picture of your daughter, isn't it?
是你女兒的照片，對吧？

228
00:15:32,660 --> 00:15:36,390
Well, she's lovely. I like a girl with a strong jaw.
她真是甜美 我喜歡有堅毅下巴的女孩

229
00:15:39,030 --> 00:15:41,760
I'll call you from Tulsa.
我會從土爾沙打電話給你的

230
00:15:45,770 --> 00:15:48,300
Hey. So how is it?
嘿，怎樣呢？

231
00:15:48,480 --> 00:15:52,410
- I broke my thumb. - Your thumb?
-我的拇指斷了 -你的拇指？

232
00:15:54,920 --> 00:15:57,650
That's weird. Are you sure you're punching right?
真是奇怪，你確定 你出拳的方式是正確的嗎？

233
00:15:57,820 --> 00:16:00,450
Make a fist.
握拳

234
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:03,150
Maybe later.
或許等一下好了

235
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:05,050
Ross, I feel terrible.
羅斯，我覺得很糟糕

236
00:16:05,230 --> 00:16:09,860
You know what, you can go. I just have to fill out some forms.
你可以走了 我只要填一些表格就可以了

237
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:16,230
You want me to help you with that?
需要我幫忙嗎？

238
00:16:16,470 --> 00:16:20,240
Why, does it look like I'm having trouble with my misshapen claw?
為什麼？我看起來像是沒辦法 使用我的畸形爪子嗎？

239
00:16:23,710 --> 00:16:25,800
Name?
姓名？

240
00:16:27,180 --> 00:16:30,050
No, I know Ross. But what's it short for?
我知道羅斯 但是那是什麼的簡稱呢？

241
00:16:30,220 --> 00:16:32,340
You know, like Rossell.
你知道的，像是羅素

242
00:16:32,890 --> 00:16:36,750
Or Rosstrophor.
或是羅斯多福

243
00:16:37,020 --> 00:16:39,550
Just Ross.
就是羅斯

244
00:16:40,190 --> 00:16:42,250
It's pretty.
好名字

245
00:16:42,900 --> 00:16:46,230
- Okay, date of birth? - You know my birthday.
-好了，生日呢？ -你知道我生日的

246
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:48,560
Sure.
當然

247
00:16:48,900 --> 00:16:53,000
May.. tember?
五…九月？

248
00:16:53,370 --> 00:16:58,570
- October 18. - Occupation? Dinosaurs.
-十月十八日 -職業？恐龍

249
00:17:00,110 --> 00:17:05,710
Actually, I'm a paleon.. Dinosaurs is fine.
事實上我是古生物… 恐龍也可以啦

250
00:17:06,050 --> 00:17:09,180
The drawing is not.
圖畫的並不是

251
00:17:12,390 --> 00:17:15,690
All right, who do you want as your emergency contact?
好了，緊急聯絡人是誰呢？

252
00:17:16,730 --> 00:17:20,030
- Rachel, I guess. - Okay. Relationship?
-瑞秋，我想應該是吧 -好的，關係呢？

253
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:23,070
Boy, this could take a while.
天啊，這可能要花上一點時間

254
00:17:26,270 --> 00:17:28,400
- Just put roommate. - Come on.
-寫室友 -少來了

255
00:17:28,580 --> 00:17:32,070
You guys are more than that. You're gonna get together, right?
你們比室友還更進一步 你們要在一起了，不是嗎？

256
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:34,250
I don't think that we are.
我不認為我們有要在一起

257
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:38,540
But you two are supposed to be together.
但是你們應該要在一起的

258
00:17:38,750 --> 00:17:41,950
Well, I thought so too. But then she said she'd marry you.
我也這樣想過 但是她卻答應要嫁給你

259
00:17:42,320 --> 00:17:44,620
Come on, Ross, that didn't mean anything.
別這樣，羅斯 那根本沒有什麼

260
00:17:44,790 --> 00:17:47,660
She'd just had the baby. She was freaked out about doing it alone.
她才剛生產完嚇壞了 要獨自扛起一切

261
00:17:47,830 --> 00:17:51,890
- She would have said yes to anybody. - Yeah, that's what she said.
-任何人求婚，她都會答應的 -是啊，她也是這樣說

262
00:17:52,070 --> 00:17:55,430
- So? - So I don't want to be just anybody.
-所以呢？ -所以我不想要當任何人

263
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,160
- Wow. - You know what?
-哇 -你知道嗎？

264
00:18:00,340 --> 00:18:03,430
It's better this way anyway.
反正這樣也比較好

265
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:07,650
I don't know what I was thinking, going down that road again with us.
我不知道我在想什麼 再回到之前的關係

266
00:18:07,820 --> 00:18:13,480
It's just much easier if we're just friends who have a kid.
如果我們純粹做朋友，只是有個小孩 那事情就會簡單多了

267
00:18:13,690 --> 00:18:15,750
- Really? - Yeah.
-真的嗎？ -是啊

268
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:19,850
- And you're okay with that? - Yes. That's what we always planned.
-你這樣沒關係嗎？ -是啊，這本來就是我們的計劃

269
00:18:20,030 --> 00:18:22,550
And if you have a plan, you should stick to it.
如果你有計劃，你就應該照計劃執行

270
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:26,160
That's why they call them plans. Hello?
這就是計劃的意義，不是嗎？

271
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:30,470
I'm fine.
我沒事的

272
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:33,070
Hey, for what it's worth..
嘿，關於瑞秋…

273
00:18:33,270 --> 00:18:37,840
with Rachel, I don't think you'll ever be just "anybody."
我不認為你會只是「任何人」而已

274
00:18:38,050 --> 00:18:41,340
Hey, there you go.
嘿，你做對了

275
00:18:42,520 --> 00:18:44,540
"Thanks."
「謝謝」

276
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:53,180
Oh, my God. How long has she been crying?
喔，天啊，她哭多久了？

277
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:55,790
About a week and a half.
大約一個半星期

278
00:18:56,030 --> 00:19:00,590
Well, it looks like you guys got it under control, so I'm just gonna go.
看起來你們都已經處理好了 所以我先回去了

279
00:19:01,870 --> 00:19:05,100
No? Really? Misery really does love company?
不好嗎？真的？ 一定要有人共享悲慘命運嗎？

280
00:19:05,310 --> 00:19:07,500
All right.
好吧

281
00:19:08,380 --> 00:19:12,000
- Try holding her a different way. - Look, I'm doing the best I can.
-試著用另一種方式抱她 -我已經盡力而為了

282
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:15,340
- Anyone else is welcome to try. - All right, I'll try. Fine.
-任何人都歡迎來試試看 -好吧，我來試試看

283
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:17,850
- Yes. Okay. Okay. - Here you go.
-好了，好的，好的 -抱去吧

284
00:19:18,020 --> 00:19:20,710
Hey. Oh, gosh.
嘿，喔，天啊

285
00:19:20,890 --> 00:19:24,050
Nothing works with this child!
這小孩什麼都沒用！

286
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:28,130
God, what am I gonna do, you guys? I can't even comfort my own baby.
天啊，我該怎麼辦呢？ 我根本照顧不了我自己的孩子

287
00:19:28,330 --> 00:19:31,020
- I'm the worst mother ever. - No, you're just new at this.
-我是史上最糟的母親 -不，你只不過是不熟悉罷了

288
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:34,430
You'll get better. Think about your first day at work.
你會克服的 想想你第一天上班的時候

289
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:37,090
That couldn't have been easy, but you figured that out.
那也不是很簡單的事 但你也擺平了啊

290
00:19:37,340 --> 00:19:42,040
Yeah, I don't think dressing provocatively is going to help me here!
是啊，我不認為穿得辣一點 對現在的情況會有幫助！

291
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:45,870
- God, just please take her. - Okay, I'll take her. Come on.
-天啊，請幫我抱一下 -好，我來抱，來吧

292
00:19:46,050 --> 00:19:48,980
Oh, boy, I have to go to the bathroom.
喔，天啊，我要去上一下廁所

293
00:19:49,150 --> 00:19:52,240
I have to go scream into a pillow.
我要去枕頭堆裡吼一吼

294
00:19:55,860 --> 00:19:59,950
Bouncy. Bouncy baby. Bouncy baby.
活潑，活潑的寶貝，活潑的寶貝

295
00:20:00,130 --> 00:20:04,960
Oh, baby, baby. Oh, baby, baby.
喔，寶貝，寶貝，喔，寶貝，寶貝

296
00:20:05,130 --> 00:20:08,470
Oh, baby, baby, baby.
喔，寶貝，寶貝，寶貝

297
00:20:10,170 --> 00:20:12,870
Have I gone deaf?
我聾了嗎？

298
00:20:14,810 --> 00:20:20,770
It worked. Oh, baby, baby, baby. Oh, baby, baby, baby.
有效了，喔，寶貝，寶貝，寶貝 喔，寶貝，寶貝，寶貝

299
00:20:20,980 --> 00:20:23,610
You must be a fireball in bed!
你在床上一定像個火球！

300
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:31,120
I can't believe it. She's asleep. I got her to go to sleep.
我不敢相信，她睡著了 我讓她睡著了

301
00:20:31,290 --> 00:20:33,690
I have actual magical powers.
我真的有神奇的魔力

302
00:20:35,660 --> 00:20:38,150
I can hear traffic and birds.
我可以聽到汽車跟鳥叫聲

303
00:20:38,330 --> 00:20:40,960
I can hear the voices in my head again.
我又再度聽到我腦海中的聲音了

304
00:20:42,970 --> 00:20:45,130
I'm kidding.
開玩笑的

305
00:20:47,980 --> 00:20:51,810
Oh, my God! You got her to stop crying!
喔，我的天！ 你讓她不再哭了！

306
00:20:52,010 --> 00:20:56,140
Yes, I did. I'm Monica, super aunt.
是的，我辦到了 我是超級姑姑摩妮卡

307
00:20:56,650 --> 00:21:01,280
- You are the official baby-crier stopper. - Yes, I am.
-你是正式的嬰兒止哭專家 -是啊，我正是

308
00:21:01,490 --> 00:21:04,980
- You're never leaving the apartment. - Say what?
-你永遠都不能離開這間公寓了 -什麼？

309
00:21:05,230 --> 00:21:09,530
That's your new job, day or night. She starts crying, I need you here.
這是你的新工作，日夜兼顧 只要她一哭，我就需要你在這裡

310
00:21:09,730 --> 00:21:13,460
- No, no, no. - Thankfully, you don't need me at all.
-不，不，不 -很慶幸，你一點都不需要我

311
00:21:13,630 --> 00:21:17,730
So okay. Hey, super aunt? See you later.
那麼，嘿，超級姑姑 下次見囉

312
00:21:17,940 --> 00:21:21,500
Rachel? Let's give it six to eight months.
瑞秋，我們試試看六到八個月

313
00:21:30,450 --> 00:21:33,150
Okay, so listen, I'm gonna go lay down.
好的，聽著，我要去睡一下

314
00:21:34,050 --> 00:21:35,080
What?
什麼？

315
00:21:35,320 --> 00:21:38,220
The book says whenever she's sleeping, I should be sleeping.
書上說只要她一睡 我也應該要睡

316
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:39,830
So..
所以…

317
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,060
Thank you.
謝謝你

318
00:21:46,470 --> 00:21:48,330
Hey.
嘿

319
00:21:48,500 --> 00:21:52,700
- We just got her to go to sleep. - So there can't be any yelling?
-我們才剛讓她睡著 -所以現在不能大聲吼叫囉？

320
00:21:54,780 --> 00:21:56,870
No.
沒錯

321
00:21:59,580 --> 00:22:02,740
- We're moving to Tulsa. - What?
-我們要搬去土爾沙了 -什麼？

322
00:22:05,850 --> 00:22:09,020
I can't.. I can't hear.
我…我聽不到

323
00:22:14,530 --> 00:22:18,560
- Hey. - Hey. Where have you been?
-嘿 -嘿，你去哪了？

324
00:22:20,570 --> 00:22:24,060
- What happened to you? - I had a little thing with Joey.
-發生什麼事了？ -我跟喬伊打了起來

325
00:22:24,270 --> 00:22:26,540
If you think this is bad, you should see him.
如果你認為這很糟糕 你應該看看喬伊

326
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:30,370
No, Ross, this is not good.
不，羅斯，這真的很糟

327
00:22:30,540 --> 00:22:34,980
We have to talk about this Joey thing. Please sit.
我們必須談談喬伊這件事，請坐下

328
00:22:38,090 --> 00:22:41,750
All right, you have got to get over this Joey thing.
好了，你必須放下喬伊這件事

329
00:22:42,220 --> 00:22:47,290
Okay? I never really wanted to marry Joey, okay?
好嗎？我從未真的 想要嫁給喬伊，好嗎？

330
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:50,290
Okay.
好的

331
00:22:52,100 --> 00:22:54,760
You know what I really, really want?
你知道我真的很想、很想要什麼嗎？

332
00:22:56,900 --> 00:22:59,370
What, Rach?
什麼？

333
00:23:00,070 --> 00:23:02,600
I wanna sleep.
我想要睡覺

334
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:09,010
I wanna eat. I wanna take a shower.
我想要吃東西，我想要洗澡

335
00:23:09,250 --> 00:23:13,410
I mean, before she wakes up, and we gotta do this all over again.
我是說，她醒來以後 我們又有得忙了

336
00:23:13,590 --> 00:23:16,850
- Right. - I mean, because I got news for you.
-沒錯 -因為我必須告訴你

337
00:23:17,020 --> 00:23:20,190
Emma: not easy.
艾□，一點都不好帶

338
00:23:21,090 --> 00:23:24,830
Well, that's what I'm here for.
那正是我在這裡的用意

339
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:31,260
- You want me to get that? - No, that's really okay.
-你要我去嗎？ -不，真的沒關係

340
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:36,000
- Monica? - Got it, got it, got it, got it.
-摩妮卡？ -來了，來了，來了

341
00:23:45,450 --> 00:23:49,120
I've been thinking about this. And I gotta tell you, it's not my fault.
我一直在想 而且我要告訴你，這不是我的錯

342
00:23:49,290 --> 00:23:51,880
- It's a natural instinct. - What are you talking about?
-那是自然的本能 -你們在說什麼？

343
00:23:52,130 --> 00:23:54,990
Okay, what would you do if I did this?
好吧，如果我這樣你會怎麼做？

344
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000

